From 8fa3f3d21f2ebeb920a97c3fcce3bb12e1e4d8cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wisnuu <wisnuandrian325@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 13:43:29 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 05/19] feat(agent_ui): scroll tall elicitation cards and
 restore canceled prompts

Cap pending elicitation forms at 420px with an internal body scroll so
Submit/Decline stay reachable, and cap the sticky banner at 480px.
On stop/cancel, restore the in-flight prompt into an empty composer.
---
